      "name": "base_sink.h",
      "filePath": "thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/base_sink.h",
      "summary": "spdlog sink 基类模板，以 Mutex 为模板参数提供线程安全的日志 sink 抽象基类，封装了 log/flush/set_pattern/set_formatter 的线程安全调用，子类只需实现 sink_it_() 和 flush_() 纯虚函数。",
      "tags": ["base-class", "template", "sink", "thread-safety", "abstract"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "使用 CRTP 风格的 Mutex 模板参数实现编译期线程策略选择，子类通过 override sink_it_() 和 flush_() 完成具体日志输出逻辑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "class:thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/base_sink.h:base_sink",
      "type": "class",
      "name": "base_sink",
      "filePath": "thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/base_sink.h",
      "lineRange": [19, 45],
      "summary": "spdlog 日志 sink 的线程安全基类模板。提供 log/flush/set_pattern/set_formatter 的 final override（内部加锁后委托给子类的 sink_it_/flush_ 等纯虚函数）。禁止拷贝和移动。",
      "tags": ["base-class", "template", "sink", "abstract", "thread-safety"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dist_sink.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "dist_sink.h",
      "filePath": "thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dist_sink.h",
      "summary": "分布式 sink（多路复用器），将日志消息分发到一组子 sink。支持动态添加/移除子 sink，并将 formatter 设置传播到所有子 sink。",
      "tags": ["multiplexer", "sink", "template", "composite-pattern", "thread-safety"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "采用 Composite 模式，内部维护 std::vector<std::shared_ptr<sink>> 实现多路日志分发。提供 dist_sink_mt（线程安全）和 dist_sink_st（单线程）两种类型别名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "class:thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dist_sink.h:dist_sink",
      "type": "class",
      "name": "dist_sink",
      "filePath": "thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dist_sink.h",
      "lineRange": [23, 75],
      "summary": "日志消息分发 sink，继承 base_sink，维护子 sink 列表并在 sink_it_() 中遍历分发到所有满足日志级别的子 sink。支持 add_sink/remove_sink/set_sinks 动态管理子 sink。",
      "tags": ["multiplexer", "composite-pattern", "sink", "template"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dup_filter_sink.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "dup_filter_sink.h",
      "filePath": "thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dup_filter_sink.h",
      "summary": "重复消息过滤 sink，在指定时间窗口内跳过与上一条相同的消息，并在出现新消息时输出一条 'Skipped N duplicate messages..' 通知。",
      "tags": ["deduplication", "filter", "sink", "template", "performance"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "通过比较消息内容和时间间隔实现去重，使用 C 风格 snprintf 格式化跳过通知消息，提供 dup_filter_sink_mt 和 dup_filter_sink_st 两种类型别名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "class:thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dup_filter_sink.h:dup_filter_sink",
      "type": "class",
      "name": "dup_filter_sink",
      "filePath": "thirdparty/spdlog/include/spdlog/sinks/dup_filter_sink.h",
      "lineRange": [40, 86],
      "summary": "重复日志消息过滤器，继承 dist_sink。在 max_skip_duration 时间窗口内，如果连续收到相同 payload 的消息则跳过，直到出现不同消息时输出跳过计数通知。",
      "tags": ["deduplication", "filter", "sink", "template"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    }
